Hands-On Activity 4 | Data Analytics Career

Researched career paths in data analytics using job platforms such as Indeed, DataJobs, and LinkedIn. Identified Business Intelligence and Machine Learning as interesting career paths, outlining potential entry points (Junior BI Analyst, Junior ML Engineer) and growth trajectories. Also researched portfolio-hosting platforms for showcasing data analytics work, comparing GitHub (repositories, README documentation, employer visibility) and WIX (visual customization, ease of use for non-technical audiences).
